    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fde65a6884ccbb198dcb69</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Sep 2023 15:52:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们采访到了小众设计师品牌 TOULES的主理人 - 小熊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她在疫情前夕开启创业：如何打造第一款爆品，如何运用线上渠道进行营销，如何面对市场的变化坚持初心？</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们来听她聊聊创业背后的那些故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>******************************************</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="264">04:24</a> &nbsp;连续2次踩中小红书风口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> &nbsp;关于直播那些事：达人选择、品牌形象与直播的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> &nbsp;“能被拼多多抄，说明你真的火了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;封城3个月的一些思考：播客和雷军的演讲给了我力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;互联网可爱的地方在于每天都是崭新的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> &nbsp;从创始人到员工都是I人的团队是什么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a> &nbsp;之后的品牌规划</span></p><span></span><p><span>******************************************</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNFt9FtXZmCV4Ke-pTWP6gAXh4h.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>TOULES杨超越同款耳饰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrILDhDPcwZVrRl2GgdVmpKc3ked.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>TOULES牵牛花戒指</span></p><span></span><p><span>关注“旷野指南针”并发送截图，领取TOULES八折优惠（客服微信: TOULES_OFFICIAL）</span></p><span></span><p><span>关注公众号：旷野指南针 （不定时更新播客文字稿）</span></p><span></span><p><span>加wx: itsfresia，备注小宇宙，拉你进听友群</span></p>]]></description>
